units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region box block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
pair_style eam/alloy
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
velocity all create 600 12345 mom yes dist gaussian
thermo 100
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 10000 iso 1 1 10000
timestep 0.001
run 220000
